#: src/AdminPage.php:142
msgid "Floating privacy button"
msgstr "Plaukiojantis privatumo mygtukas"

#: src/AdminPage.php:148
msgid "Show a floating button that reopens the privacy settings."
msgstr "Rodyti plaukiojantį mygtuką, kuris vėl atidaro privatumo nustatymus."

#: src/AdminPage.php:157
msgid "Google Tag Manager ID"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager ID"

#: src/AdminPage.php:162
msgid "Microsoft Clarity project ID"
msgstr "Microsoft Clarity projekto ID"

#: src/AdminPage.php:167
msgid "Hotjar site ID"
msgstr "Hotjar svetainės ID"

#: src/AdminPage.php:172
msgid "Hotjar script version"
msgstr "Hotjar scenarijaus versija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:177
msgid "Meta Pixel ID"
msgstr "Meta Pixel ID"

#: src/AdminPage.php:182
msgid "LinkedIn partner ID"
msgstr "LinkedIn partnerio ID"

#: src/AdminPage.php:201
msgid "Polylang disclosure"
msgstr "Polylang informacija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:207
msgid ""
"Show the Polylang language cookie for multilingual sites and WooCommerce "
"shops."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti Polylang kalbos slapuką daugiakalbėms svetainėms ir WooCommerce "
"parduotuvėms."

#: src/AdminPage.php:219
msgid "WooCommerce disclosure"
msgstr "WooCommerce informacija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:225
msgid ""
"Show WooCommerce cart, checkout, session, and source attribution cookies."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti WooCommerce krepšelio, atsiskaitymo, seanso ir šaltinio priskyrimo "
"slapukus."

#: src/AdminPage.php:237
msgid "Meta for WooCommerce consent bridge"
msgstr "Meta for WooCommerce sutikimo integracija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:243
msgid "Hold Meta for WooCommerce tracking until marketing consent is granted."
msgstr ""
"Sulaikyti Meta for WooCommerce sekimą, kol suteikiamas rinkodaros sutikimas."

#: src/AdminPage.php:255
msgid "PixelYourSite consent bridge"
msgstr "PixelYourSite sutikimo integracija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:261
msgid ""
"Control PixelYourSite browser pixels, server events, cookies, and Google "
"Consent Mode values from this consent banner."
msgstr ""
"Valdyti PixelYourSite naršyklės pikselius, serverio įvykius, slapukus ir "
"Google Consent Mode reikšmes iš šio sutikimo banerio."

#: src/AdminPage.php:273
msgid "Site Kit Sign in with Google disclosure"
msgstr "Site Kit Sign in with Google informacija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:279
msgid ""
"Show Site Kit’s Sign in with Google and One Tap cookies as required "
"functional cookies."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti Site Kit Sign in with Google ir One Tap slapukus kaip būtinus "
"funkcinius slapukus."

#: src/AdminPage.php:291
msgid "Triple Whale Pixel consent bridge"
msgstr "Triple Whale Pixel sutikimo integracija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:297
msgid ""
"Control the Triple Whale WooCommerce plugin pixel with marketing consent."
msgstr ""
"Valdyti Triple Whale WooCommerce įskiepio pikselį pagal rinkodaros sutikimą."

#: src/AdminPage.php:309
msgid "Klaviyo disclosure"
msgstr "Klaviyo informacija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:315
msgid ""
"Show Klaviyo cookies when the Klaviyo WooCommerce plugin loads tracking "
"outside this plugin’s control."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti Klaviyo slapukus, kai Klaviyo WooCommerce įskiepis įkelia sekimą už "
"šio įskiepio kontrolės ribų."

#: src/AdminPage.php:327
msgid "WoodMart disclosure"
msgstr "WoodMart informacija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:333
msgid ""
"Show WoodMart cookies for wishlist, compare, product history, popups, and "
"shop preferences."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti WoodMart slapukus pageidavimų sąrašui, palyginimui, produktų "
"istorijai, iššokantiesiems langams ir parduotuvės nuostatoms."

#: src/AdminPage.php:345
msgid "Wordfence disclosure"
msgstr "Wordfence informacija"

#: src/AdminPage.php:351
msgid ""
"Show Wordfence security cookies for the firewall, access controls, login "
"alerts, and linking."
msgstr ""
"Rodyti Wordfence saugumo slapukus užkardai, prieigos valdikliams, "
"prisijungimo įspėjimams ir susiejimui."

#: src/AdminPage.php:363
msgid "YouTube blocking"
msgstr "YouTube blokavimas"

#: src/AdminPage.php:369
msgid "Block and replace YouTube embeds until marketing consent is granted."
msgstr ""
"Blokuoti ir pakeisti YouTube įterpinius, kol suteikiamas rinkodaros sutikimas."

#: src/AdminPage.php:397
msgid ""
"Configure the consent texts and vendor IDs used by the frontend Klaro banner."
msgstr ""
"Konfigūruokite sutikimo tekstus ir tiekėjų ID, naudojamus lankytojams "
"rodomame Klaro baneryje."

#: src/AdminPage.php:426
msgid "WP Consent API was not detected."
msgstr "WP Consent API neaptikta."

#: src/AdminPage.php:427
msgid ""
"The consent controls will still render, but the WordPress compatibility "
"bridge will stay inactive"
msgstr ""
"Sutikimo valdikliai vis tiek bus rodomi, tačiau WordPress suderinamumo tiltas "
"liks neaktyvus"

#: src/AdminPage.php:431
msgid "until the API plugin is available."
msgstr "kol API įskiepis bus pasiekiamas."

#: src/AdminPage.php:441
msgid "Another plugin already provides the WP Consent API consent type."
msgstr "Kitas įskiepis jau pateikia WP Consent API sutikimo tipą."

#: src/AdminPage.php:445
msgid ""
"Viktor's Consent and Tracking Guard preserves that value; "
"verify that only one consent management platform"
msgstr ""
"Viktor's Consent and Tracking Guard išsaugo šią reikšmę; "
"patikrinkite, kad tik viena sutikimų valdymo platforma"

#: src/AdminPage.php:449
msgid "controls the site."
msgstr "valdytų svetainę."

#: src/AdminPage.php:457
msgid "Set the text displayed in the consent notice and preferences dialog."
msgstr "Nustatykite tekstą, rodomą sutikimo pranešime ir nuostatų dialoge."

#: src/AdminPage.php:461
msgid "Use [privacy-policy] to insert WordPress’ configured Privacy Policy URL."
msgstr ""
"Naudokite [privacy-policy], kad įterptumėte WordPress sukonfigūruotą "
"privatumo politikos URL."

#: src/AdminPage.php:470
msgid "Enter only the services that this site uses."
msgstr "Įveskite tik tas paslaugas, kurias ši svetainė naudoja."

#: src/AdminPage.php:475
msgid "Control how visitors can access their privacy settings."
msgstr "Valdykite, kaip lankytojai gali pasiekti savo privatumo nustatymus."

#: src/AdminPage.php:530
msgid "Klaro’s default"
msgstr "Klaro numatytasis"

#: src/AdminPage.php:531
msgid "Viktor’s default"
msgstr "Viktor numatytasis"

#: src/AdminPage.php:532
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Šviesus"

#: src/AdminPage.php:533
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Tamsus"

#: src/AdminPage.php:534
msgid "Twenty Twenty-Five"
msgstr "Twenty Twenty-Five"

#: src/AdminPage.php:535
msgid "CookieNo"
msgstr "CookieNo"

#: src/AdminPage.php:559
msgid "Klaro’s default applies no custom modal theme;"
msgstr "Klaro numatytasis stilius netaiko pasirinktinės modalinio lango temos;"

#: src/AdminPage.php:560
msgid "the component stylesheet only positions and styles plugin controls."
msgstr "komponentų stilių failas tik išdėsto ir stilizuoja įskiepio valdiklius."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:332
msgid "There were changes since your last visit, please renew your consent."
msgstr ""
"Nuo paskutinio jūsų apsilankymo buvo pakeitimų, prašome atnaujinti sutikimą."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:336
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Sužinoti daugiau"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:337
msgid "Testing mode!"
msgstr "Testavimo režimas!"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:346
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Visada"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:347
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Taip"

