msgid "Polylang"
msgstr "Polylang"

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:957
msgid ""
"Stores the visitor’s last browsed language for Polylang and Polylang for "
"WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Saugo paskutinę lankytojo naršytą kalbą Polylang ir Polylang for WooCommerce."

#: src/Frontend/Assets.php:966
msgid ""
"Remembers the selected language for multilingual content and translated "
"WooCommerce flows."
msgstr ""
"Įsimena pasirinktą kalbą daugiakalbiam turiniui ir išverstiems WooCommerce "
